    "detailed_description": "THERE\u2019S SOMETHING WRONG WITH\u2026  is a short video game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><br>It\u2019s a first-person horror experience set in the eerie and enigmatic tunnels.<br>As players navigate through dark passages, they will discover notes, interactive objects, and unusual human remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The creature</h2><br>However, not everything within those tunnels is lifeless. Players will encounter a dangerous creature. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replicator</h2><br>The game does not feature a traditional Inventory system. By using a special tool called the Replicator, players will be able to copy specific elements of the environment and paste them onto other unique areas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide</h2><br>The monster cannot be defeated or even harmed. The only viable approach will be to rely on stealth and hiding tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The main story can conclude with three different endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><br>A man wakes up in the forest, with no memory of how he ended up there. He is lost. Confused. Scared. And completely alone.<br><br>He recalls that once again, he had a vision of a mysterious entrance. The haunting image of this entrance lingers in his mind with every blackout.<br><br>As the man wanders through the woods in search of a way out, he eventually enters the tunnels. What he discovers within the dark and mysterious passages will change his life forever...",
    "about_the_game": "THERE\u2019S SOMETHING WRONG WITH\u2026  is a short video game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><br>It\u2019s a first-person horror experience set in the eerie and enigmatic tunnels.<br>As players navigate through dark passages, they will discover notes, interactive objects, and unusual human remains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/526b63134a24c1d6fa79c197268d1d25.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The creature</h2><br>However, not everything within those tunnels is lifeless. Players will encounter a dangerous creature. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/17e34a7202c569f5eae1798fbb8f8416.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replicator</h2><br>The game does not feature a traditional Inventory system. By using a special tool called the Replicator, players will be able to copy specific elements of the environment and paste them onto other unique areas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/f0d5067f412f1f26a80259f5d7a02b53.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hide</h2><br>The monster cannot be defeated or even harmed. The only viable approach will be to rely on stealth and hiding tactics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.poster.avif?t=1742730813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.webm?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836580/extras/1fb0cefe3e3b578e36002de754114e9f.mp4?t=1742730813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The main story can conclude with three different endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><br>A man wakes up in the forest, with no memory of how he ended up there. He is lost. Confused. Scared. And completely alone.<br><br>He recalls that once again, he had a vision of a mysterious entrance. The haunting image of this entrance lingers in his mind with every blackout.<br><br>As the man wanders through the woods in search of a way out, he eventually enters the tunnels. What he discovers within the dark and mysterious passages will change his life forever...",
